      "content": "Excellent! Your **Trip Planning Team** is ready. Here\u0027s what you now have:\n\n**The Team Structure:**\n- **Trip Coordinator** (manager) \u2014 Receives the traveller\u0027s request and orchestrates the specialists. It gathers their recommendations and assembles them into a single, organized trip proposal.\n- **Flights Specialist** \u2014 Recommends flight options with airlines, times, prices, and booking details.\n- **Hotels Specialist** \u2014 Recommends accommodations with locations, amenities, prices, and booking details.\n- **Activities Specialist** \u2014 Recommends activities and attractions with descriptions, times, prices, and booking details.\n\n**How it works:**\nWhen you give the team a trip request (destination, dates, budget, preferences), the coordinator asks each specialist for recommendations. Once all three have responded, the coordinator assembles everything into a comprehensive proposal the traveller can review and book.\n\n**What you need to provide:**\n- The Anthropic API connection is already set up with your credentials.\n- When you run the team, give it the traveller\u0027s trip details: destination, travel dates, budget, preferences, and any special requirements.\n\nNothing is saved yet. Review the team in your workspace and save it when you\u0027re ready.",
